  "description": "The target file's options.open_timeout (V7): the per-target override of config.yaml's worker.open_timeout, the bound on a shell's open. Integer seconds, 1 to 9007199254740, as the other per-target timer overrides. Valid: 20; 1; absent, so the knob applies. Invalid: 0; a Go duration string \"20s\"; a non-integer; a value past the maximum.",
  "corpus": [
    "Storage §3.2",
    "session model §11",
    "decision 5.36",
    "lang-arch §7.3"
  ],
